# Frontend Rules — React + TypeScript + Inertia.js

## Architecture

- **Inertia.js v2** — No API layer. Controllers render Inertia pages with props.
- **Pages**: `resources/js/Pages/` — Each file maps to a route via `Inertia::render('PageName')`
- **Layouts**: `resources/js/Layouts/` — `AppLayout.tsx` (main sidebar layout), `GuestLayout.tsx` (auth pages)
- **Components**: `resources/js/components/` (custom) + `resources/js/components/ui/` (shadcn/ui) + `resources/js/Components/` (legacy Breeze)
- **Hooks**: `resources/js/hooks/`
- **Types**: `resources/js/types/index.d.ts` — All entity interfaces
- **Utilities**: `resources/js/lib/utils.ts` — `cn()` helper (clsx + tailwind-merge)

## Path Aliases

```
@/ → resources/js/
ziggy-js → vendor/tightenco/ziggy
```

## Component Patterns

### Page Components

```tsx
import { Head } from '@inertiajs/react';
import AppLayout from '@/Layouts/AppLayout';

interface Props {
    entity: EntityType;
}

export default function MyPage({ entity }: Props) {
    return (
        <AppLayout>
            <Head title="Page Title" />
            {/* content */}
        </AppLayout>
    );
}
```

### Inertia Forms

```tsx
import { useForm } from '@inertiajs/react';

const { data, setData, post, processing, errors } = useForm({
    name: '',
});

const submit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    post(route('resource.store'));
};
```

### shadcn/ui Components

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` (new-york style)
- Available: alert-dialog, avatar, badge, breadcrumb, button, card, collapsible, command, dialog, dropdown-menu, form, input, label, popover, scroll-area, select, separator, sheet, sidebar, skeleton, table, tabs, textarea, tooltip
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional class merging

## Styling

- **Tailwind CSS 3** with utility-first approach
- **Brand colors**: use hex values directly (`#0E83DC`, `#485E72`, `#69A748`, `#C0C5C0`)
- **CSS variables** for shadcn/ui theming (defined in `resources/css/app.css`)
- **Font**: Hanken Grotesk / Inter (loaded via Google Fonts)
- No dark/light toggle on public pages — single unified light theme with brand colors
- App interior uses shadcn/ui CSS variable-based theming (light/dark support)

## Icons

- Use **Lucide React** exclusively (`lucide-react` package)
- Import individual icons: `import { IconName } from 'lucide-react'`
- Standard sizing: `h-4 w-4` (small), `h-5 w-5` (medium), `h-6 w-6` (large)

## Routing in JavaScript

- Use Ziggy's `route()` helper: `route('routename', { param: value })`
- Use `<Link href={route('routename')}>` for Inertia navigation
- Use `router.visit()`, `router.post()` for programmatic navigation

## Forms & Validation

- **react-hook-form** + **Zod** for complex client-side forms
- **Inertia useForm** for simple CRUD forms
- Always show server-side errors from `errors` prop

## Rich Text Editors

- **Editor.js** — used in note/content contexts
- **Tiptap 3** — used for rich page editing (tables, code blocks, mentions)
- **Lexical** — used for advanced document editing (checklist, markdown shortcuts)
- Each editor has its own component in `resources/js/components/editor/`

## TypeScript Types

- All entity interfaces defined in `resources/js/types/index.d.ts`
- Key types: `User`, `Workspace`, `Project`, `Board`, `BoardColumn`, `Item`, `Page`, `Bookmark`, `BookmarkItem`, `Label`, `Comment`, `Attachment`
- `PageProps` extends Inertia's base props with `auth.user`
- Always type component props with explicit interfaces

## Toasts & Feedback

- Use **Sonner** for toast notifications: `toast.success('Message')`
- Flash messages come from Inertia shared data via `usePage().props.flash`
